        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Emperor",
        "content": "Nah."
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[name=\"Emperor\"]   Looks like our lucky little Bison had a smooth landing. He can get hisself back here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Emperor",
        "content": "Looks like our lucky little Bison had a smooth landing. He can get hisself back here."
