    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[name=\"Croissant\"]   Um... he took a forty-foot drop onto a smooth landin'? How's that?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Croissant",
        "content": "Um... he took a forty-foot drop onto a smooth landin'? How's that?"
