    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   I think we lost them.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "I think we lost them."
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   So what's Texas and the girls gotten themselves into this time? Who are they fighting now?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "So what's Texas and the girls gotten themselves into this time? Who are they fighting now?"
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1#4\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   Can I really trust you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "Can I really trust you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1#4\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]   I guess I better introduce myself. I'm Mostima. A Messenger for Penguin Logistics.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "I guess I better introduce myself. I'm Mostima. A Messenger for Penguin Logistics."
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1#4\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#4",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   I think that makes me your colleague, for now. I usually work alone though.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "I think that makes me your colleague, for now. I usually work alone though."
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1#2\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   ...Mostima. I've heard that name from my father before.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "...Mostima. I've heard that name from my father before."
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   (Not to mention a Sankta with black horns... the rumors were true. Better not ask about them though...)",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "(Not to mention a Sankta with black horns... the rumors were true. Better not ask about them though...)"
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1#2\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   Oh...? Good things I hope?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "Oh...? Good things I hope?"
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   Erm... how should I say...? Just baseless rumors...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "Erm... how should I say...? Just baseless rumors..."
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   And after you saved me like that, I have no reason to doubt you. Sorry.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "And after you saved me like that, I have no reason to doubt you. Sorry."
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   Don't worry about it. You got nothing to apologize for.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "Don't worry about it. You got nothing to apologize for."
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   Thanks... Now we should share our intelligence... although I'm still pretty confused.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "Thanks... Now we should share our intelligence... although I'm still pretty confused."
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   Basically, Penguin Logistics is in some kind of conflict with an arm of the Siracusan mafia.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "Basically, Penguin Logistics is in some kind of conflict with an arm of the Siracusan mafia."
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   Right. Got it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "Right. Got it."
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1#2\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   Huh? You got it already?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "Huh? You got it already?"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1#2\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   I don't need any more. You need to stop thinking so much. Trust your instincts. That's the Penguin Logistics way.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "I don't need any more. You need to stop thinking so much. Trust your instincts. That's the Penguin Logistics way."
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   Oh. So the trick is to just stop thinking, huh...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "Oh. So the trick is to just stop thinking, huh...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   They're a very special bunch. Common sense doesn't really work here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "They're a very special bunch. Common sense doesn't really work here."
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   ...What about you, Mostima?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "...What about you, Mostima?"
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 149,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   Are you always this direct with people?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "Are you always this direct with people?"
    },
    {
        "id": 150,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"Bison\"]   I- I think so.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Bison",
        "content": "I- I think so."
    },
    {
        "id": 152,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_325_bison_1\",name2=\"char_213_mostma_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 153,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   We need to get moving.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "We need to get moving."
    },
    {
        "id": 154,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mostima\"]   Follow me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mostima",
        "content": "Follow me."
    },
